---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageTitle: "Flashcards Practice — English Vidya"
metaDescription: "English शब्दों को Flashcards से याद करें — वैज्ञानिक तरीके से अभ्यास करें। 19,773 शब्द 148 categories में।"
permalink: /flashcards/
---

{% set breadcrumbs = [
  { label: "Home", url: "/" },
  { label: "Flashcards" }
] %}
{% include "partials/breadcrumbs.njk" %}

<div class="hero-welcome animate-fade-in dict-hero">
  <h1 class="dict-hero-title">🃏 Flashcards Practice</h1>
  <p class="hero-subtitle">See, memorise and listen to words — वैज्ञानिक तरीके से याद करें!</p>
</div>

<div class="category-accordion animate-fade-in dict-category-container">
  {% for mainGroup in groupedCategories %}
    <details class="category-main-folder dict-main-folder">
      <summary class="dict-main-summary">
        📁 {{ mainGroup.name }}
        <span class="dict-summary-icon">▼</span>
      </summary>
      
      <div class="dict-sub-folder-container">
        {% for subGroup in mainGroup.subCategories %}
          <details class="category-sub-folder dict-sub-folder">
            <summary class="dict-sub-summary">
              📂 {{ subGroup.name }}
              <span class="dict-summary-icon">▼</span>
            </summary>
            
            <div class="dict-cards-grid">
              {% for cat in subGroup.items %}
                <a href="/flashcards/{{ cat.slug }}/" class="word-card dict-word-card">
                  <div class="dict-word-card-icon">{{ cat.icon | default('📄') }}</div>
                  <div>
                    <div class="dict-word-card-title">{{ cat.name }}</div>
                    <div class="dict-word-card-count">{{ cat.count }} words</div>
                  </div>
                </a>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
          </details>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </details>
  {% endfor %}
</div>



<noscript>
  <div class="card" style="padding: var(--sp-8); text-align:center;">
    <h2 class="dict-word-card-title">JavaScript Required</h2>
    <p>Flashcards ke liye JavaScript enable karein.</p>
  </div>
</noscript>
